EmitInstrsModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Emits a block instruction list, calling EmitInstr for each.
    Provides: EmitInstrs(state, instrs) -> state. instrs — IR instruction list; returns state with appended bytes.
    DependsOn: EmitInstr.
    Composition: Native Include from modules/GenWasm/GenWasm.sir (Path: ../EmitInstrs/EmitInstrs.sir).
    Notes: plain iterator; all encoding logic lives in EmitInstr.
